# Web Chat channel configuration
# ---

# HMAC secret value collected by setup and stored as
# stash/vaults/secrets/channel_chat_secret, not in stack.env.
# Runtime exposes CHANNEL_SECRET_FILE to chat and
# CHANNEL_CHAT_SECRET_FILE to guardian.
# Auto-generated during instance creation if left blank.
# @required @sensitive
CHANNEL_CHAT_SECRET=
